# UI: shadcn/ui via `@bokdy/ui`

Interactive UI primitives (Button, Input, Label, Card, Combobox, DropdownMenu, …) live in [`packages/ui`](packages/ui) as **shadcn/ui-style** components (Radix + CVA + Tailwind). Apps import from `@bokdy/ui` — do not reinvent menus, dialogs, or selects with ad-hoc `useState` + absolute divs.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — hand-rolled dropdown
<button onClick={() => setOpen(!open)} />
{open ? <ul className="absolute …">…</ul> : null}

// ✅ GOOD — Combobox / DropdownMenu from @bokdy/ui
import { Combobox, Button } from "@bokdy/ui";
```

Locale and theme switchers must use **Combobox** (Popover + Command) with the **nav dropdown layout** in `.cursor/rules/frontend-dropdown-layout.mdc` (Meronfarm-style: ghost trigger, icon + `sm:` label, `ChevronDown`, check only when selected on the right, `rounded-xl` panel).

## Conventions

- Add new primitives under `packages/ui/src/ui/` following shadcn structure; export from `packages/ui/src/index.ts`.
- Prefer existing `@bokdy/ui` exports before copying another design system into an app.
- Domain chrome (auth shell, feature layouts) may compose primitives; it must not replace them.
- Stack freeze: Tailwind + shadcn/ui — see `docs/architecture/tech-stack.md` / `AGENTS.md`.
